MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- preferences.js: drop dataCollection from GD_HIDE_CSS (telemetry opt-outs stay reachable).
- run_gd_prefs.py: check the data collection group in the redesigned Permissions and data pane.
- GreatDANELegacy: only remove a legacy root when fingerprint is in KNOWN_FPS AND subject matches AND it is self-issued.
- run_gd_legacy.py: lookalike test (same subject/issuer, different key) is kept.
